asset:        aepx-pair.aepx
title:        After Effects project fixture (combined): cases 000, 058, 060, 110 and 124 (the XML .aepx half of the .aep / .aepx pair)
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-28 by vangel76
notes:        Generated from scratch by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026, driven by the generator in `tests/fixtures/tools/` (one composition per case, named like the case; tests/fixtures/CASES.md), as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. Saved by After Effects as .aepx right after the .aep of the same name; the XMP packet in its ProjectXMPMetadata element was replaced by the base project's packet, so both halves carry the same one.
